  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 060</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>60 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"60번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:56%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q060\" data-question=\"Q060\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q060</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Repeated reads of the same product data make database responses slow. Which in-memory layer can cache the data with a short TTL?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon ElastiCache</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q060\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">ElastiCache</a>가 빈번한 읽기를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 부담을 줄인다. 무효화와 장애 시 원본 접근도 설계한다.</p></